{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-service#feature-1","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-service","commit":"255c1cd3f8d2f4a78832e03de0ca82beda391aa4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-service 的功能「按状态列出服务」：调用 win_services 可按 running 或 stopped 状态过滤 Windows 服务，并设置返回数量上限；结果列出服务名、显示名、状态和启动类型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/service-exec.js:35-42","lib/service.js:4-11","lib/service.js:28-49"]}
